    ],

    "object.fireplace.name":"Fireplace",
    "object.fireplace.description": [ "The fireplace is so big you could fit inside without even having to try too hard. The sound of the fire crackling, its unmistakable smell and warmth feel out of place in the otherwise silent and abandoned space, but they are nonetheless greatly appreciated.", 
