      "Shifting slightly to get a better look you discover a metal key. Untouched by the fire, but unreachable as long as it stays burning."
      
    ],

    "object.fireplace.off": [ "You splash the content of the backet into the cracling fireplace, effectively extinguishing the flames. You immediately mourn their loss, but at least now you’re able to reach for the metal key.", 
